The '''Thunder''' is a {{Legendary}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from lava on the [[Crimson Isle]]. 

== Spawning ==
'''Thunder''' can be fished up from any Lava source on the [[Crimson Isle]]. It requires {{skl|fishing|36}} or higher to be fished up, as well as the [[Odger#Rewards|Novice Trophy Fisher]] title.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for the '''Thunder''' is {{Green|40}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|0.86%|1|116.2|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:
