== Behavior ==
'''Thunder''' has 3 attacks, which all give {{Item|Empty Thunder Bottle}} charges if they hit the player:
* Jumps into the air and quickly falls down, damaging players under it. ({{Green|20}} Charges)
* Shoots a laser at a nearby player, dealing {{Stat|Damage|2,000}}. ({{Green|10}} Charges)
* Creates a circle of white and blue particles around a nearby player, then shoots a Sea Lantern at it. After 1 second, the Sea Lantern will land inside the circle and damage players for {{Stat|Damage|15,000}} inside. ({{Green|5}} Charges)

When killed, '''Thunder''' explodes into 5-9 sparks. The amount depends on if the player has a [[Pulse Ring]], and its [[Rarity]], which increases the amount of sparks '''Thunder''' drops if the player is within 20 blocks of it when it dies. The sparks can be right-clicked on with an {{Item|Empty Thunder Bottle}} to gain {{Green|250}} Charges for that bottle per spark.

